1
00:00:00,269 --> 00:00:01,289
(Raj:)Hey.

2
00:00:01,504 --> 00:00:02,804
- Sorry we're late.
- Hey.

3
00:00:03,005 --> 00:00:04,495
(Penny:)No problem. We just sat down.

4
00:00:04,674 --> 00:00:07,264
- Mm. Would you like some wine?
- Fill her up.

5
00:00:10,012 --> 00:00:11,532
(Bernadette:)I'll tell you when to stop.

6
00:00:14,016 --> 00:00:15,316
(Penny:)Is everything okay?

7
00:00:15,518 --> 00:00:17,038
(Howard:)Terrific. Couldn't be better.

8
00:00:17,353 --> 00:00:18,513
(Bernadette:)Oh, bite me.

9
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:23,490
(Howard:)We can still have a nice night.
Just tell me where it is.

10
00:00:23,693 --> 00:00:26,993
(Bernadette:)If you did what you said
you were gonna do, I'd tell you.

11
00:00:27,163 --> 00:00:30,693
- Uh, where what is?
- She hid my Xbox like I'm a child.

12
00:00:32,735 --> 00:00:36,565
(Howard:)My mom got me that for my birthday,
so if you don't give it back, I'm telling.

13
00:00:38,441 --> 00:00:42,001
(Bernadette:)I've been working late every night.
All I asked was he clean the apartment...

14
00:00:42,211 --> 00:00:44,111
(Bernadette:)...and do one load of laundry.
Did he? No.

15
00:00:44,347 --> 00:00:45,937
He kept on playing
that stupid game.

16
00:00:46,382 --> 00:00:49,872
(Bernadette:)You like pushing buttons so much,
try pushing them on the washing machine.

17
00:00:52,021 --> 00:00:57,021
- I said I'm sorry.
- Sorry doesn't clean my underpants, buddy.

